    <metaDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[One of the themes at this year’s Codegarden, the annual conference from Umbraco, was the “composable” digital experience platform (DXP) – a concept that’s getting more and more attention in the customer experience space.]]></Value>
    </metaDescription>
    <metaTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Umbraco’s place in the composable DXP: takeaways from Codegarden 2022]]></Value>
